{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DrgtUAIU0h1794908944.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>無綫集團和華潤電力宣布，成為第一批「無紙化」股份。</p><p></p><p>繼港交所宣布，率先於明年三月底前，成為第一間落實「無紙化」的上市公司後，無綫集團和華潤電力也宣布，分別於明年3月8日和22日正式實施，成為第二和第三間參與證券。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T10:52:40.918325+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T09:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T23:15:31.944795+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T10:46:00.313568+00:00","content_hash":"cbd405d3d66bfc9457542873f9dede7a22367b173eba65e71ceacd63186cb863","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T10:52:40.918325+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}